,"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"`id` 也决定配置段：`[plugin.com.example.weather]`。三层优先级（包默认 < 运行时落盘 <\n用户配置）与 `set_config` 的写规则见配置文件 · 插件自己的配置段。"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"默认配置文件的例子（它的顶层就是一段配置，不要写 `[plugin.x]` 头）："},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#pluginjson","content":"脚本插件的 `plugin.json` 可以只写身份，`entry` 指向脚本："},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"发布时打一个 zip，**zip 根就是插件目录的内容**，不要套一层目录："},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"打包要求："},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"只放运行需要的东西：不要带 `node_modules/`、`.venv/`、`target/`、`.git/`；"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"不要放符号链接；"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"单个 zip 不超过 50MB，解压后不超过 200MB，文件数不超过 2000；"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"文件名不要以点或空格结尾，不要用 `CON`、`NUL`、`COM1` 这类 Windows 保留名\n（大小写也算冲突）；"},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"资产名建议 `<id>-<version>-<平台>.zip`，例如\n`com.example.weather-1.2.0-windows-x86_64.zip`；纯脚本包用 `-any.zip`。\nAndroid 用 `android-aarch64` / `android-x86_64`，入口是 `.so`（例如\n`bin/libweather.so`），不能拿 Linux 的包代替。"},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#打包成-zip","content":"商城按资产名和 `plugin.json` 校验，不符合上面的规则会被拒绝收录。"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"新建项目默认已配置官方商店（`fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugins].registry_url`）。\n换商店改那一行，删掉则关闭商店。"},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#从商店安装","content":"运行 `fuyubot run --tui`，进「商店」页搜索、选中、安装，然后重启实例。"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#本地目录安装","content":"原生包装进 `plugins/<id>/`，脚本包装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n也可以用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装单个 `.dll`（旧形态），但推荐目录包。"},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#手动安装","content":"把 zip 解压到 `plugins/<id>/`，或者把目录直接拷进去，然后重启："},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin list` 看不到 | 目录不在 `plugins/` 下，或 `plugin.json` 读不了；确认路径与权限 |","table":"table-1"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象             | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 提示 `id` 与目录不一致 | 目录名和 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 不同会以 `id` 为准；改名保持一致 |","table":"table-1"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理              |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| 提示平台不匹配 | 压缩包不是给当前系统的；换对应平台的资产 |","table":"table-1"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象      | 原因 / 处理                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 提示入口不存在 | `entry` 写错，或打包时漏了 `bin/` 里的文件 |","table":"table-1"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象           | 原因 / 处理                                       |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 启动时报 ABI 不匹配 | 插件编译时的 ABI 与宿主不一致；用与宿主同版本的 `fuyubot-abi` 重新编译 |","table":"table-1"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#排查","content":"| 现象       | 原因 / 处理                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载后名字对不上 | `plugin_init` 返回的名字必须等于 `plugin.json` 的 `id` |","table":"table-1"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#卸载","content":"只删插件目录，`[plugin.<id>]` 配置和 `data/plugins/<id>/` 不会被删。"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"page","content":"订阅与事件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"on/off/emit、过滤器、双通道与归属"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"双通道：具体 `@type` 与兜底 `update`"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"过滤器"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"归属：`emit` 不是广播"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"Rust"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"事件总线是插件拿到 TDLib 更新的唯一入口，也是插件之间说话的方式。三个动作：\n`on` 订阅（返回句柄）、`off` 退订（或让句柄 drop）、`emit` 发自定义事件。"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新会被**同时**发到两条通道上："},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道                                | 谁收         | 什么时候用    |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 具体的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage` 等） | 精确订阅了它的监听器 | 你只关心一种更新 |","table":"table-0"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道         | 谁收           | 什么时候用                 |\n| ---------- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| `\"update\"` | 订阅兜底通道的所有监听器 | 你要看全部，或不想追 TDLib 的类型名 |","table":"table-0"},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道           | 谁收               | 什么时候用              |\n| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `\"response\"` | **只发给发起那个请求的插件** | 收 `td_invoke*` 的结果 |","table":"table-0"},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"`\"update\"` 与 `\"response\"` 是 ABI 常量（`UPDATE_EVENT` / `RESPONSE_EVENT`），别自己拼字符串。"},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条更新从进来到落到你的回调，中间是这样走的："},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"更新分发：穿过管线后同时发到两条通道"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TDLib 的更新经接收循环交给 UpdatePipeline，穿过 PreUpdate、PreRoute、InPlugin、PostResponse 四个阶段后，被同时发到具体 @type 通道与兜底 update 通道，分别落到精确订阅的插件与订阅兜底的插件。"},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TdClient 接收循环"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条原始 JSON 更新进来"},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"UpdatePipeline::process_value"},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"六阶段，实跑 4 个"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreUpdate"},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"0 · 刚进来"},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreRoute"},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"1 · 解析 @type"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"InPlugin"},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"2 · 可改负载"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PostResponse"},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"3 · 收尾"},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"中间件挂在阶段上；一条更新只跑一遍，不是每个监听器一遍"},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"同时发两条"},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"具体 @type 通道"},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"updateNewMessage、……"},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"兜底 update 通道"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新都发一份"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 A"},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"精确订阅 updateNewMessage"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 B"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"订阅兜底 update，或带过滤器"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"**两条通道是「同时」，不是「二选一」**：一条 `updateNewMessage` 既会敲精确订阅它的监听器，也会敲所有\n订阅了 `\"update\"` 的监听器。过滤器在两个通道上各判一次，所以订阅兜底又写了过滤器的那一侧不会因为\n「没命中精确通道」而漏掉。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄不会自动退订。`HostApi::on` 返回的是 `SubscriptionHandle`（一个 `u64`），\ndrop 它什么也不会发生；要提前退订就自己留住句柄并调 `host.off(handle)`。\n插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚。"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload: *const c_char) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；\n`payload` 是宿主临时的 NUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`serde_json::from_str` 解析）。"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"脚本侧的事件模型与此完全相同（同样的通道、同样的点分过滤），只是入口换成了薄 SDK\n的 `on(event, handler, filter)`。那一套不在本板块：见脚本插件。"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"page","content":"外部仓库插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"不进本体 workspace 的原生插件，怎么接依赖、怎么拿插件目录"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"依赖：只能走 path"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件目录：别自己算"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"线程：回调里不能做慢事"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"装与验"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"一个真实例子"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"下一步"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"内置插件（`/start`、`/help`、`/plugins`）跟着发布包走，**第三方插件不必**：\n它们自己一个仓库、`cargo build` 出一个 cdylib，用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装进项目。"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"形态和内置插件完全一样（同一个 `define_plugin!`、同一张 `HostApiVTable`），\n差别只在三件事：**依赖怎么接**、**插件目录在哪**、**运行时库能不能从 crates.io 拿**。"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"运行时仓库只往 crates.io 发两个 crate：`fuyubot-abi` 和 `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`。\n**`fuyubot-simplify` 是 `publish = false`**——它不在 crates.io 上。"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"把它写成 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会**编不过**（crates.io 上没有这个版本）。\n等它发版之后换成一行版本号就行。"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 在这里只当「人话参数 → TDLib 请求体」的构造器库用：\n`SendMessageParams` / `Media` / `Text` / `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_*_params`。\n「发出去并等结局」那一步走 ABI v5 的 op JSON 分发——\n和 Python / JS / Go 插件同一条路。"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件是宿主进程 `dlopen` 出来的动态库，`std::env::current_exe()` 拿到的是 **`fuyubot.exe`**，\n不是插件自己的目录——插件算不出自己旁边有什么文件。"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"要读同目录的静态资源（cookie、词表、模板），让宿主告诉你：\n`plugin_start` 的 `config_json` 里带着 `plugins_dir`（绝对路径）。"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"内置 `manage` 插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"`updateNewMessage` 的回调跑在**宿主的接收循环线程**上。解析网页、调外部 API、\n等 TDLib 应答——任何一件在这里同步做，都会把整个宿主堵死（同进程所有插件一起卡）。"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"⚠️ 那个 `JoinHandle` **必须存进插件状态并在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**：\n宿主卸载动态库之后，线程还在跑库里的代码就是**未定义行为**。"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"`--replay-wait` 给插件的静默窗口：要发慢速网络请求时调大，否则进程可能在请求发出前就退了\n（默认原生插件只有 150 ms）。见 离线回放。"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"FuyuBot-Douyin——抖音解析插件，\n`/dy <链接>` + 消息里自动识别抖音链接。它演示了本文全部三件事：\npath 依赖、靠 `plugins_dir` 读 cookie、回调里 spawn 工作线程。"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"同类做法另见 `XQAnimeBot-Rust`（把 MongoDB / qBittorrent / ffmpeg 各自拆成一个插件，\n业务插件按服务名取用）。"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调：在 `plugin.c` 里加桥"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到七个导出符号\n就认它。Go 这条路线没有脚手架——照本页的结构自己搭，ABI 头文件从 `fuyubot-abi` 落盘\n（见 C 与 C++ 插件）。"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 没有脚手架模板，也没有官方的 `go-ping` 示例——照下面这几段自己搭工程。\nC 头文件仍然由 `fuyubot-abi` 生成，两门语言共用同一份，不要手抄。"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（由 `fuyubot-abi` 的 `PLUGIN_HEADER` 落盘），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"1044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"1045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"本页的 `plugin.c` 只带了两个桥（`fy_log` / `fy_invoke`）。要用别的 ABI 函数就照同样形状加——\n**每个桥一行转发**，Go 侧不碰函数指针："},"1047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"Go 侧声明 + 包一层："},"1048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"三条 cgo 侧的硬规则："},"1049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"传给 C 的字符串用 `C.CString` + `defer C.free`；漏了就是泄漏。"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"桥返回的 `const char *` 是**宿主缓冲**：`C.GoString` 立刻拷贝，**不要**把 `*C.char` 存下来，\n也**不要** free 它。"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"订阅句柄留在 C 侧（`plugin_start` 里 `g_host->on(...)` 存进静态变量），Go 侧不持有——\ndrop 即退订，交到 Go 手里容易漏。"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> Go 没有脚手架（见页首），但可以直接调 VTable 上的\n> `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `invoke(sendMessage, …)`。"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：在 `plugin.c` 里加一座 `simplify_invoke` 桥（和 `fy_invoke` 同形状），Go 侧就能像\n调普通函数一样发 op——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"`\n通道回投（带 `request_id`，与 `fy_invoke` 的响应同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `invoke(\"sendMessage\", …)` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                               |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText` |","table":"table-1"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | 先 `fy_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"先把 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 落到工程里（见 C 与 C++ 插件 › 头文件），然后："},"1064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 24 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"一个 cdylib = 一个插件：七个导出符号、依赖声明与最小闭环"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"原生插件：七个导出符号"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"声明依赖：`inject` 与 `soft_inject`"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"本板块只讲**原生插件**：一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`）就是一个插件，\n用 Rust / C / C++ / Go 写，直接和宿主同进程跑 C ABI。"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** Python / JS / TS 不走这条路。脚本能力完全由独立的\n`fuyubot.script` 插件提供，见脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，装上就跑。"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认这七个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读它来决定激活顺序 |","table":"table-0"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 干什么                                  |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-0"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | 只在 ABI 版本不匹配时被调——那一刻不能调 `plugin_stop`，只能用它把 `init` 分配的状态还回来 |","table":"table-0"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商、服务作用域）见 ABI 契约。"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小可跑的 Rust 插件全文见 Rust 插件；C / C++ / Go 见各自页面。"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 按 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}` 找产物（两边都有时取较新的）。插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，\n`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，靠最后一档照样能找到，不需要额外参数。"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 不编译、也不打包插件：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-1"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 七个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-1"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `5` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，不能调 `plugin_stop`，但会调 `plugin_free_handle` 把状态还回来 |","table":"table-1"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                                                             |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅句柄要自己管 | `HostApi::on` 返回 `SubscriptionHandle`（`u64`），drop 不会退订；要退订就 `host.off(handle)` |","table":"table-1"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-1"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-1"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"manifest 里能声明两个列表，它们决定**宿主什么时候让你跑**、以及**跑的顺序**："},"1104":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段       | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                            |\n| -------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `inject` | 硬依赖 | **不激活**。停在 `Pending` 等着，等你缺的东西出现 |","table":"table-2"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段            | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                  |\n| ------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `soft_inject` | 软依赖 | 照常激活，只是排在「软依赖也齐了」的插件后面 |","table":"table-2"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"依赖名可以写两种东西，宿主都认："},"1107":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**服务名** —— 比如 `\"storage.mongo\"`，宿主查 `Context` 里有没有这个名字"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**插件名** —— 比如 `\"fuyubot.manage\"`，宿主查同名插件是不是 `Active`"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"硬依赖决定能不能跑，软依赖只决定排队位置"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject 里的名字不齐就不激活，停在 Pending 等着；soft_inject 只影响排序，不齐也照常激活。名字可以是服务名，也可以是插件名。"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject（硬）"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;storage.mongo&quot;]"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不齐就不激活"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"soft_inject（软）"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;cache.redis&quot;]"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"只影响排队位置"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"宿主检查：这个名字在不在？"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"服务名或插件名都认"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不在"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"在"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"Pending"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"等着——不是失败"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"激活"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排在有软依赖的后面"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"三件事值得先记住："},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**`Pending` 不是失败。** 它表示「还没轮到」或「等的东西还没来」。真正的失败只有两种：\n你的 `plugin_start` 报错，或者你依赖的**提供者已经 `Failed`**（那时你也会被级联标成 `Failed`）。"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**软依赖不保证顺序。** 它只是排序偏好：软依赖齐的先上，不齐的也照样上，只是排后面。\n要「他必须先于我」就写 `inject`，别用 `soft_inject`。"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**依赖是准入，不是注入。** 宿主不会把那个服务的引用塞给你——你仍然自己去 `get_service`\n拿。`inject` 只保证「轮到我的时候它一定在」。"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排查看 `fuyubot status`：`pending` 那一栏会列出插件名**和它还缺哪些**。"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"完整实例见插件联动：内置 `/help` 用共享服务暴露命令表，\n`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 用 `soft_inject` + `call_service` 把自己的命令登记进去。"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"简化封装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/simplify/\" />"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"外部仓库插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/external/\" />"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/plugin-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/plugin-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"异步等待\" href=\"/docs/plugin/async/\" />"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/plugin-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/plugin-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/plugin-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/plugin-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名来自插件包根上的 `plugin.json`**（静态读，不加载）；没有清单的旧形态平铺 dll\n只能按文件名认。`fuyubot plugin list` 两种都列。"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/plugin-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"脚本插件的目录与身份是另一套（`plugins/scripts/<目录>/` + `[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n见脚本插件。"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"page","content":"插件联动","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"用共享服务互相调用、用软依赖排好启动顺序——以内置 /help 的命令注册为例"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"先选通道"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"`/help` 的联动结构"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"提供方：把能力做成服务"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"1. 写方法"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"2. 打包 VTable 与它引用的缓冲"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"3. `start()` 注册，`stop()` 放下"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"4. 提供方也要能单独活"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"消费方：按名字调用 + 软依赖"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"`soft_inject` 做了什么、没做什么"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"软依赖写服务名还是插件名？"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"软还是硬？"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"生命周期与所有权"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"其它语言"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"排查"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"一页检查清单"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"插件之间没有共享的 Rust 类型，也没有彼此的符号表。原生插件（cdylib）跑在同一个进程里，\n但只通过宿主的 C ABI 打交道。想「A 把自己的能力借给 B 用」，只有宿主提供的那几条通道。"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"这篇讲最常用的一条：**命名服务 + 软依赖**。例子就是内置的 `/help`——\n它把命令表暴露成一个进程级服务，`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 在启动时把自己的命令登记进去，\n而它们之间没有一行互相 import 的代码。"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事             | 通道               | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 广播「发生了什么」，不关心谁在听 | 事件总线 `emit` / 订阅 | 否    | 否      |","table":"table-0"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                               | 有返回值        | 对方必须在？   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| 调一个能力，**当场要结果** | 命名服务 `provide_service(_shared)` + `call_service` | 是（JSON 字符串） | 是（调用那一刻） |","table":"table-0"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 让宿主 / AI 能发现并调用 | 工具表 `register_tool` + `call_tool` | 是    | 是      |","table":"table-0"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事           | 通道                       | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| 只要求「我启动时它已经在了」 | `inject` / `soft_inject` | —    | 不负责传值  |","table":"table-0"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"服务适合「一个插件提供能力、其它插件按名字调」：命令注册表、缓存、鉴权、数据源都属于这一类。\n它不替代事件——事件是**通知**，服务是**调用**。两者可以叠：服务方法内部照样能 `emit`。"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"内置 `/help` 把命令表暴露成进程级服务 `fuyubot.help.commands`，方法有两个："},"1171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法         | 入参                                      | 返回                                            |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `register` | `{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"开始使用\"}` | `{\"ok\":true}`；坏入参回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-1"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法     | 入参  | 返回                                                          |\n| ------ | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list` | 忽略  | `[{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"…\"}, …]`，即 `/help` 实际渲染的内容 |","table":"table-1"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"服务名建议用反向域名（`fuyubot.help.commands`），方法名用动词；协议字段**只增不改**，\n破坏性改动时把 `ServiceVTable.version` 加一（宿主不校验，但调用方可以据此判断）。\n坏入参不要 panic——回一个带 `error` 的 JSON，调用方才有机会降级。"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"三个插件各管一段："},"1175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件             | 做什么                                                                    |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 提供方 | `fuyubot.help` | `start()` 里 `provide_service_shared` 注册服务；`/help` 渲染时合并动态注册表（带归属）与静态基线 |","table":"table-2"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件              | 做什么                                                              |\n| --- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.start` | `soft_inject` 声明软依赖；`start()` 里 `call_service(…, \"register\", …)` |","table":"table-2"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件               | 做什么              |\n| --- | ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.manage` | 同上，登记 `/plugins` |","table":"table-2"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"消费方**不链接** help 插件，也不 import 它的任何代码。它只认两个字符串——服务名和方法名——\n外加一份两边都认的 JSON 协议。"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"> 实例源码在运行时仓库的 `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-help`、`plugins/fuyubot-plugin-start`、\n> `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-manage`；这篇只摘和联动有关的部分。"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"下面代码用 `fuyubot-abi` 的类型写（三个内置插件就是这么写的）。外部 Rust 插件直接依赖\ncrates.io 上的 `fuyubot-abi` 即可，拿到的是同一套 `ServiceVTable` / `ServiceMethod` /\n`Plugin` / `define_plugin!`。"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"服务方法只有一个签名：收 JSON、回 JSON（或 `NULL` 表示「成功但没输出」）。"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"方法跑在**调用方线程**上。消费方若在命令回调（接收循环线程）里调它，这里就不能做慢事——\n否则整个宿主一起卡住。要慢慢做的活，在方法里排个队、立刻返回。"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"⚠️ `ServiceMethodFn` 是 `extern \"C\"`，**方法里不能有 panic**：逃出这个边界的 panic 会直接\nabort 整个宿主，不是只挂你的插件。解析失败回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}`；确实可能 panic 的\n代码段自己 `catch_unwind`。"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`ServiceVTable` 里全是裸指针：`name` 指向服务名，`methods` 指向方法数组，每个方法项又指向\n自己的名字。这些缓冲必须和 VTable **活一样久**，所以打包进同一个结构体，一起放进 `Box`："},"1185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"这里有几个容易写错的点："},"1186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`Vec` 的**堆缓冲**在结构体移动时不会跟着搬，所以 `Box::new` 之后 `names[i].as_ptr()` /\n`methods.as_ptr()` 仍然有效。**别在注册之后再 `push`**——重新分配会让宿主手里的指针悬空。"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`version` 是提供方自己的协议版本，宿主**不校验**；它只用于调用方自己判断。"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`context` 会原样传给每个方法。需要实例状态就把 `self` 指针放这里；`/help` 用它放\n**宿主句柄**（`HostApi`），注册时才能回问「谁在调我」——这是 `plugin_init` 交给你的那份\n`HostApi`，`Copy` 且可以跨线程，配套的 `Box` 只是为了让地址稳定。"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"**跨插件共享必须用 `provide_service_shared`。** `provide_service` 写的是调用者自己的\n子作用域，兄弟插件沿父链往上看不到它；两个插件各注册一份同名私有服务也不会冲突，\n但也就谈不上联动。`_shared` 写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞——所以它必须显眼。"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"`ServiceHandle` **不是** RAII：它没有 `Drop`，丢在一边不会注销。正常也不需要手动注销——\n插件卸载时宿主按 owner 回滚它注册的一切，共享服务也一样（写在根表也记得 owner）。\n这里的 `Option<Box<HelpService>>` 只是为了**保活 VTable**，不是为了「用句柄控制注册」。"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"`/help` 的静态基线 `BUILTIN_COMMANDS` 始终包含 `start` / `help` / `plugins` 三个命令；\n动态注册表**优先**（它带宿主判定的归属），静态基线只补缺。所以："},"1192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"没有消费方登记命令，`/help` 仍然列得出内置三件套（只是不标归属）；"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"消费方没起来，只是少几条带归属的动态条目，不会让 `/help` 整个失效。"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"这是可选联动的通用做法：**提供方给自己留一份能独立工作的兜底**，别把「有人来调我」\n当成自己启动的前提。"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`fuyubot.start` 的接线只有两段：`start()` 里调服务，`soft_inject()` 里声明排队偏好。"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`call_service` 是普通安全函数，返回 `Result<String, AbiError>`："},"1197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"服务不存在 / 方法不存在 / 方法指针是 `None` → `Err`；"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回 `NULL` → `Ok(String::new())`（「成功但没输出」）；"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回字符串 → 立刻拷成 `String`，调用方拿到的是自己的一份，可以随便留着。"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"⚠️ 目前错误类型不细分「服务不存在」和「没有这个方法」，都是 `AbiError::BadString`。\n所以日志里要把服务名、方法名一起打出来，否则排查时只看得到一句「失败了」。"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读 `plugin_manifest` 里的依赖列表（`define_plugin!` 会把\n`Plugin::soft_inject()` 写进去）。同步阶段分两轮："},"1202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"先激活「硬依赖齐 **且** 软依赖也齐」的插件；"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"再激活「只有硬依赖齐」的插件。"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"所以同一批加载时，只要 help 能正常起来，它一定先于 `/start` 和 `/plugins` 激活——\n不管文件名的字典序怎样。"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"但它**不是**「提供方一定在」的保证："},"1206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 自己卡在硬依赖上（停在 `Pending`），消费方的软依赖就不算齐，第二轮照样会激活\n消费方。这时 `call_service` 会失败。"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 的 `start()` 报错（`Failed`），软依赖同样不阻塞消费方。"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"运行期中提供方被卸载，消费方仍然处于 `Active`、不会重新跑 `start()`；之后的每次调用\n都要自己处理错误。"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"一句话：**软依赖管排队，不管可用性**。所以上面的 `match` 分支不是客套，是必须的。"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"`inject` / `soft_inject` 里的名字，宿主认两种："},"1211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                             | 宿主查什么                    | 什么时候用                 |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 服务名（`\"fuyubot.help.commands\"`） | 根作用域的 `Context` 里有没有这个名字 | 推荐。换一个插件提供同名服务，排序仍然成立 |","table":"table-3"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                    | 宿主查什么              | 什么时候用               |\n| --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 插件名（`\"fuyubot.help\"`） | 有没有同名插件处于 `Active` | 只关心「那个插件」而不是「那个能力」时 |","table":"table-3"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"⚠️ 软依赖写**私有**服务名是排不上序的：兄弟插件看不到它，管理器在根作用域里也查不到。\n跨插件的能力一律走 `provide_service_shared`，依赖也写同一个服务名。"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                      | 选择                    |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 没有 `/help` 也要能跑，只是少一条登记 | `soft_inject` + 运行期降级 |","table":"table-4"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                     | 选择            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 没有数据库 / 鉴权就完全没意义，宁可别启动 | `inject`（硬依赖） |","table":"table-4"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                 | 选择                 |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| 只要求「它先起来」，不直接调它的服务 | `soft_inject` 写插件名 |","table":"table-4"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景             | 选择                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| 能力名稳定、可能有替代提供者 | `soft_inject` 写服务名 |","table":"table-4"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"硬依赖的语义是**准入**：缺了就不激活，停在 `Pending` 等；如果提供它的插件已经 `Failed`，\n依赖方会被级联标成 `Failed`，而不是永远假装在等。但它也不传值——到了 `start()` 里，\n你仍然要自己 `get_service` / `call_service`。"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"依赖声明不要写进配置：manifest 是权威来源，`define_plugin!` 从 trait 自动生成。\n只有没有 `plugin_manifest` 的 v3 老插件，宿主才回退到 `[plugin.<名字>].inject` /\n`.soft_inject`（manifest 该侧非空时**覆盖**配置，不是合并）。见插件总览。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                      |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候注册 | `start()`。`init()` 阶段插件还没被准入，别在那时对外暴露能力 |","table":"table-5"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事         | 规则                                       |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 注册进宿主的是什么 | 裸指针，**不复制**。VTable 和它引用的字符串 / 方法数组必须一直活着 |","table":"table-5"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                                                |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候释放 | `plugin_stop` 先跑，然后宿主 `rollback_owner` 撤销注册。`stop()` 里放下 `Box` 即可 |","table":"table-5"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事    | 规则                                                                 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 同名冲突 | `provide_service_shared` 返回无效句柄，宿主只打一条 `warn`；调用方必须检查 `is_valid()` |","table":"table-5"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 方法返回值 | 提供方持有，宿主当场拷走；不要跨调用保存那个指针 |","table":"table-5"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事                 | 规则                         |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `get_service` 的指针 | 同样是借的。别长期缓存——提供方一旦卸载，指针就悬空 |","table":"table-5"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                   |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 方法在哪跑 | 调用方线程，同步执行。命令回调里调服务 = 在接收循环线程上跑，不能阻塞 |","table":"table-5"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                               |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 输入可信吗 | 共享服务任何插件都能调。方法里自己校验 JSON、限制大小、别信 `context` 之外的东西 |","table":"table-5"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言   | 提供方                                          | 消费方                                     |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `provide_service` / `provide_service_shared` | `call_service`，或 `get_service` + 自己扫方法表 |","table":"table-6"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言      | 提供方                | 消费方                                             |\n| ------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| C / C++ | VTable 里第 9 / 20 项 | `get_service` + 按 `method_count` 扫 `methods[i]` |","table":"table-6"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言  | 提供方                       | 消费方 |\n| --- | ------------------------- | --- |\n| Go  | 同上（c-shared 不能卸载，见 ABI 页） | 同上  |","table":"table-6"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言               | 提供方  | 消费方                  |\n| ---------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| Python / JS / TS | 暂不支持 | 薄 SDK 还没暴露服务调用，见脚本插件 |","table":"table-6"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"C 侧的字段布局与调用示例见 插件 ABI 和\n原生插件。"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"`/help` 里少了一条命令：先看 `start` / `manage` 的日志有没有\n`… 已向 /help 注册命令：{\"ok\":true}`；失败那条会带 `call_service` 的错误。"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"服务注册失败：宿主日志里有一行 `注册共享服务 … 失败: 命名服务 … 已经注册过了`\n（或「收到了空 vtable」）。"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"谁在跑、谁在等：`/plugins` 走宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.plugins` 服务，会列出\n`active` / `pending`（带 `missing`）/ `failed`（带 `reason`）；`fuyubot status` 读的是\n实例发布的同一份快照（摘要 + pending / failed 明细）。"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"依赖声明从哪来：`plugin_manifest`。激活时日志里那行\n`激活 <名字> v<版本>（硬依赖 N、软依赖 M）` 就是宿主实际读到的数量；`status` 里的\n`pending` / `missing` 也是按它算的。别只改配置——manifest 非空时配置那份会被覆盖。"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"提供方用 `provide_service_shared`，方法名和 JSON 协议写进文档。"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"VTable、方法数组、名字缓冲装在同一个 `Box` 里，注册后不再扩容。"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"检查 `ServiceHandle::is_valid()`；`stop()` 里放下持有物，不手动 free 宿主的东西。"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"消费方对 `call_service` 的失败有降级分支，不 `unwrap`。"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"可选联动用 `soft_inject`，并接受「提供方可能不在」；缺了就活不了才用 `inject`。"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"方法里不做慢活、不阻塞调用方线程；也不让 panic 逃出 `extern \"C\"` 边界。"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"page","content":"迁移到目录包","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"把平铺的 dll 和旧脚本插件改成 plugins/<id>/ 结构"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","t