page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"确认后执行："},"1258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"它会："},"1259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对每个平铺 dll（带同名 `.dll.disable` 的也认）读取导出信息，取插件 id 和版本；"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"新建 `plugins/<id>/bin/`，把 dll 和它旁边同名的依赖文件一起移进去；"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"写一份 `plugin.json`；"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对旧脚本目录补一个 `plugin.json`（脚本本身不动）；"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"内置插件和已经是目录包的插件跳过，重复执行不会重复迁移。"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"迁移完再跑一次 `fuyubot plugin list`，然后启动实例验证。"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"> Go 编译的 c-shared 插件在迁移时会**永久映射**进当前进程，迁移进程随后退出，不会再卸载它。\n> 这是正常现象；`--dry-run` 不会写文件。"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#手工迁移","content":"自动迁移不适用时，按下面的步骤做。"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"建目录 `plugins/<id>/bin/`；"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"把 `weather.dll` 移进去，旁边运行时需要的依赖库也一起移；"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"在 `plugins/<id>/plugin.json` 写："},"1270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"`id` 必须和插件 `plugin_init` 返回的名字一致；`version` 写真实版本，不要写 `0.0.0`。"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件仍然放在 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，只需要补一个可选的 `plugin.json`："},"1272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"`kind` 写 `python` 或 `js`，`entry` 指向入口脚本。脚本自己的 `pyproject.toml` /\n`package.json` 保持原样。"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"`plugin list` 里能看到目录包，版本、平台、依赖都对；"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"回放 / 启动日志里没有 `BundleNameMismatch`、`PlatformMismatch`、`EntryMissing`；"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"原来的命令、服务和配置段还能用。"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"迁移只是移动文件，没有改插件本体："},"1277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"把 `plugins/<id>/bin/` 里的 dll 和依赖移回 `plugins/`；"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"删掉 `plugins/<id>/`；"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"脚本插件删掉新加的 `plugin.json` 即可。"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"回滚前先停掉正在运行的实例。"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**迁移后插件没加载**"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"平铺 dll 和目录包同时存在时，两个都会被扫到，可能重复注册。迁移是「移动」，\n正常情况下不会同时存在；手工迁移时记得删掉平铺那份。"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"检查 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 是否与 `plugin_init` 的名字一致。"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `GoRequiresManifest`**"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"Go 插件没有 `plugin.json` 时加载器拒绝加载，因为 Go 的库一旦映射就不能卸载。\n先迁移出 `plugin.json` 再启动；或者用 `fuyubot plugin migrate` 处理。"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `platforms` 不匹配**"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"`platforms` 为空或 `[\"any\"]` 表示全平台；否则必须包含当前系统，例如\n`windows-x86_64`、`linux-aarch64`、`macos-aarch64`。"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**脚本插件被当成原生插件**"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"脚本目录要放在 `plugins/scripts/` 下，不要放在 `plugins/` 根上。"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**配置段还需要改吗**"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"不需要。配置段仍是 `[plugin.<id>]`；迁移只改目录结构，不改插件 id。"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 `fuyubot-abi` 的 Rust 定义生成，\n权威副本是 `fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER`，别手改。"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。Rust 侧有 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见 异步等待；\n脚本侧有自己的异步写法，见脚本插件。"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"工程里加一个 `build.rs` 把头文件落出来（与 Rust 插件同一个来源）："},"1305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"`cargo build` 之后工程根上就有 `fuyubot_plugin.h`；C 与 C++ 共用这一份。"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                   |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`；宿主与静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-0"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"1319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"1320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"1325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"1326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> C / C++ **不需要**任何封装——直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` /\n> `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `sendMessage`。"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、\n超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"` 事件回投（带 `request_id`，与你收 TDLib 响应是同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"`on_update` 里按 `request_id == rid` 配对，就能从那条 `response` 事件里取出 `simplifyResult` JSON\n（和 `td_invoke_simplified` 的响应是同一个 `on` 通道，逻辑完全复用）。"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名与字段名以\n`td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 只写 `<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`（原子替换），**不改** `fuyubot.toml`；\n用户在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写过的键会拒绝写（见 配置文件）。"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1369":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1376":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1379":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"依赖 fuyubot-abi，实现 Plugin trait + define_plugin! 的最小写法"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调与状态"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"常用 ABI 速查"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"注册一个带处理器的工具"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-abi`。\n它给出 `HostApi`（VTable 的 Rust 封装）、`Plugin` trait、`define_plugin!` 宏与\n`ResponseRouter`；**没有第二层 SDK**——写插件就是实现一个 trait，再把 C ABI 导出交给宏。"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。\n`fuyubot-abi` 的版本号跟着宿主走（当前 ABI 版本是 **5**）。"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"`define_plugin!(类型, \"插件名\")` 展开出七个导出符号\n（`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` /\n`plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`），\n并把插件的名字、crate 版本、`inject` / `soft_inject` 填进 `plugin_manifest`。"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 订阅 / 注册都写在这里；`config_json` 是宿主传来的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选，回收 `Box::into_raw` 之类的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                        | 对应符号              | 说明        |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | --------- |\n| `inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 硬依赖：缺了不激活 |","table":"table-0"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                             | 对应符号              | 说明          |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| `soft_inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 软依赖：只影响排队顺序 |","table":"table-0"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还把 `init` / `start` / `stop` 包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和回调的\n`C-unwind` 是两层，**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去："},"1406":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"订阅句柄**不会**在 drop 时自动退订——`SubscriptionHandle` 只是个 `u64`。\n要提前退订就留住它、调 `host.off(handle)`；插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚，\n但 `user_data` 指向的状态还是得自己释放。"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段（见配置文件）。"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`plugin_start` 收到的 `config_json` **不是**这一段。那是宿主给的运行环境信息\n（`plugins_dir` / `scripts_dir` / `spawn` 等）；你自己的配置要用 `get_config(\"你的插件名\", key)` 读。"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段 |","table":"table-1"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` **只写你自己那一个文件**（`<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`，原子替换），\n不碰 `fuyubot.toml`——用户写在里面的注释、顺序、凭据都安全。三层优先级，以及「用户在\n`fuyubot.toml` 里钉住的键会拒绝写」，见配置文件 · 插件自己的配置段。"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"`HostApi` 上的方法就是 VTable 的一对一封装（都替你处理了 `CString` 与线程局部缓冲）："},"1413":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                   |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| 打日志  | `log(LogLevel, &str)` |","table":"table-2"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                                           |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `on(event, Some(filter), cb, user_data)` / `off(handle)`；过滤器是 `{\"字段路径\": 期望值}` |","table":"table-2"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么   | 用哪个                                       |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 发自定义事件 | `emit(event, payload_json)`——只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                                        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `td_invoke_simplified(method, params_json)`；响应走 `\"response\"` 通道（见调用 TDLib） |","table":"table-2"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么        | 用哪个                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------- |\n| 同步执行不碰网络的方法 | `td_execute(request_json)` |","table":"table-2"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                                                      |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 工具   | `register_tool(descriptor, handler, user_data)` / `register_tool_meta` / `call_tool` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` |","table":"table-2"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                           |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务   | `provide_service`（自己作用域）/ `provide_service_shared`（进程级）/ `get_service` / `call_service`，见插件联动 |","table":"table-2"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                      |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件  | `use_middleware(Stage::InPlugin, cb, user_data)`，见工具与中间件 |","table":"table-2"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么  | 用哪个                                                                             |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等一条更新 | `wait_for_update(filter_json, timeout_ms)`（阻塞）或 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见异步等待 |","table":"table-2"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                               |\n| ---- | --------------------------------- |\n| 看别人  | `list_tools()` / `list_plugins()` |","table":"table-2"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么         | 用哪个                                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| simplify 操作表 | `simplify_invoke(op_json)` / `simplify_invoke_result(op_json)`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表 |","table":"table-2"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"只想登记声明、不要处理器，就用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor_json)`。"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n七个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"page","content":"Simplify 封装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"fuyubot-simplify 的 API 参考：按功能范围分组的参数结构体、链式设置器与返回值"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"别的语言怎么用同一套语义"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"1. 文本内容：`Text` 与 `ParseMode`"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"2. 发送：`SendMessageParams`"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"话题：`Topic`"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"3. 媒体：`Media` / `InputFile` / `Thumbnail`"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"4. 相册：`SendAlbumParams`"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"5. 编辑、删除与应答"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"6. 内联键盘：`ReplyButton`"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"7. 命令与输入"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"8. 等待与订阅"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"9. 实体与下载"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"10. 富消息"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"11. 管理权：`AdminRight`"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"12. 转发：`ForwardParams`"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"13. 表情反应：`Reaction`"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"14. 连接状态：`ConnectionTracker`"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"15. 不挂在 `Simplify` 上的公开函数"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"16. 参数名为什么是这几个"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"17. 异步版：`*_then`"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"18. 返回值与错误"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"19. 简化事件"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 只做一件事：**把 TDLib 的输入拼好、把结果等回来**，返回值仍然是 TDLib 的原始 JSON\n（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`）。"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"它是**运行时仓库里的 crate，不发 crates.io**（`publish = false`），所以只能按路径依赖："},"1452":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"写 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会编不过。不想引路径依赖就用宿主暴露的 op 表\n（`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表）。"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"三条贯穿全部方法的约定："},"1454":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号；唯一的例外是 `formatted`（同步调用，压根没有等待）。"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**等待的方法是阻塞的**。插件的更新回调就跑在 TDLib 接收循环那个线程上，在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。回调里一律用 `*_then`（见第 13 节）。"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"失败一律是 `Err(SimplifyError)`，成功时的返回值见第 14 节。"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"本文按**功能范围**分组；想知道这些方法内部怎么实现（为什么这么拼、为什么这么等），\n看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"**ABI v5 起这套语义不再只有 Rust 有。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑**同一份** `fuyubot-simplify` 代码\n（`fuyubot-simplify::ops`），经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张 **op 表**："},"1459":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"所以 Go / C / C++ / JS / TS / Python 插件都能用「发消息等结局、超时撤回、bot 与用户号挑不同反应\n方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树」，行为与 Rust 侧**逐字一致**——没有第二套实现。\n完整清单与结果形状见 ABI › simplify 操作表。"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"Rust 插件**仍然用本页这些类型化方法**：它们有编译期检查与链式设置器，比拼 JSON 舒服。\n`ops` 那层是给「没有 Rust 类型系统可用」的调用方准备的。"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"除了发/改/删，这一层还收了四件「TDLib 里没有直觉上那个方法」的事：\n管理权 / 转发 /\n表情反应 / 连接状态。"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"带标记的文本**不由本 crate 解析**——经**同步**的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`\n（为什么不能用异步，见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的里的「文本链路」一节）。"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '原始文本（还没解析的那种）。', type: 'String', required: true, }, parse_mode: { descriptio…\" />"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"快捷构造：`Text::plain` / `Text::markdown` / `Text::markdown_v2` / `Text::html` / `Text::new(text, mode)`；\n`&str` / `String` 直接转成纯文本。"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Plain`（默认） | **不发请求**，直接 `formattedText { text, entities: [] }` |","table":"table-0"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `Markdown`  | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 1` |","table":"table-0"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode`  | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `MarkdownV2` | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 2` |","table":"table-0"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`    |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `Html`      | `textParseModeHTML` |","table":"table-0"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"⚠️ **注意：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，不是 `**x**`。**\n`**bold**` 会被吞成 `bold` 而且**不给** bold entity，`__x__` 出来的是下划线。别按 CommonMark 的直觉写\n——这正是「不自己实现解析」的理由。"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"拿到结果也没干活不符预期：**拿不到就退回纯文本**并打一条 `Warn` 日志（没接 TDLib、TDLib 报错都一样），\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该整条发不出去。"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"`simplify.send_message(chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Value>`（**最终**那条 `Message`）。"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '文本。只填它就是纯文本消息；和 media 一起填时它是那件媒体的标题。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None'…\" />"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"常用构造：`SendMessageParams::text(\"你好\")` / `SendMessageParams::media(photo)`，\n其余字段走 `..SendMessageParams::default()`。"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"`topic_id` 不是裸 id，是 TDLib 的 `MessageTopic`——**四个构造器各有各的 id 类型**，选错了 TDLib 就拒："},"1475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                 | 用在哪                  | 发出的 `topic_id`                                     |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::forum(id)` | **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                  | 用在哪           | 发出的 `topic_id`                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Topic::thread(id)` | **非论坛**群组的评论串 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                           | 用在哪     | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::direct_messages(id)` | 频道的私信话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicDirectMessages\",\"direct_messages_chat_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                          | 用在哪   | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::saved_messages(id)` | 收藏夹话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicSavedMessages\",\"saved_messages_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"⚠️ 刻意**没有** `From<i64>`：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种，\n隐式转任何一个都会在另一种群里静默发错。（这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，非论坛群以外全是错的。）"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","ur