d":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号把去程与回程对上"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件调 td_invoke 拿到请求号，宿主注入字符串 @extra 后发给 TDLib；响应回来时接收循环按 @extra 认出归属，转成数值 request_id，再经 emit_scoped 只发回发起这个请求的插件。"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"去程"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"td_invoke → 请求号 N"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"HostRuntime"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"注入 @extra = \"N\""},"1672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"TDLib"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"真的发出去"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应回来"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"回程"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"接收循环 route()"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"按 @extra 认出归属"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"emit_scoped"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"response 通道"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"发起的插件"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"过滤器 request_id = N"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"同一条 @extra 把去程和回程对上；没接 TDLib 时只发合成请求号，永远等不到响应"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`，类型是 `MessageTopic`——**论坛**群组用 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":N}`，**非论坛**群组的评论串才是 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`（用 `Topic` 就不会选错） |","table":"table-1"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"1697":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准：在运行时仓库里搜 `sendMessage`，或者看\n`td_api.tl`。"},"1698":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。"},"1699":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"它的**完整 API 参考（按功能范围分组）在 Simplify 封装**；\n想知道为什么这么拼、为什么这么等，看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。\n本页只留跟「请求号 + 线程」有关的那两件事——它们是这层最容易被搞错的部分。"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号。分两类："},"1701":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                               | 等到什么                                                                                                    | 返回值                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发送类（`send_message` / `send_message_album` / 富消息） | 响应（**还没发出去**的临时消息）+ 它的**发送结局**：`updateMessageSendSucceeded`（里面有最终 `Message`）或 `updateMessageSendFailed` | 最终 `Message`（相册是与 `medias` 同序的 `Vec`） |","table":"table-2"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                                        | 等到什么     | 返回值                  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 其余（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`） | 只有**响应** | 改完的 `Message` / `()` |","table":"table-2"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来；"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"相册的 `timeout_ms` 是**整组共用**的一个预算（先等 `Messages` 响应、再等 N 条结局），不是每项各等一次；"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**超时先撤回**：到期还没结局，就先 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条没发出去的消息撤掉，再返回\n`Timeout`——发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消；"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"`@type == \"error\"` 的响应一律变成 `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（例如 `Message is not modified`），\n**封装层不重试**：限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"等更新要靠**接收循环**那个线程送回来，而插件的更新回调就跑在它上面——在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`：把等待挪到另一个线程，结局交给闭包。"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码\n（未定义行为）。三个内置插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"便捷方法把等待收进去了：发送类等**响应 + 发送结局**，其余等**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。\n想自己接原始 JSON，底层出口 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update` 仍然公开。"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三个参数 `onResponse`（Python 是 `on_response`），响应按请求号\n自动配对，脚本不用自己记。细节在脚本板块：Python /\nJS 与 TypeScript。"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"静态检查导出符号"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么   | 用什么                                               | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看导出符号 | `dumpbin /exports`（Windows）/ `nm -D`（Linux/macOS） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                         | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | ----- |\n| 跑一遍更新管线 | `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么    | 用什么                           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | ----- |\n| 装进插件目录 | `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么                              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 看装了哪些插件 | `fuyubot plugin list`（静态读清单，不加载） | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 做什么     | 用什么           | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------- | ------------- | ----- |\n| 真登录、真更新 | `fuyubot run` | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"宿主只认七个符号，缺 `plugin_init` 一定加载失败。**不要用 `dlopen` 去验**——那会在你的进程里\n跑插件的初始化代码，已经算加载了。直接读导出表："},"1727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"应该看到 `plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string`，\n以及可选的 `plugin_manifest` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_free_handle`。\n看不到 `plugin_init` = 宿主一定拒绝，先查 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]` 和 `extern \"C\"`。"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"三个版本别混："},"1729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**宿主 ABI 世代** = `HostApiVTable::version`（当前 5），就在 VTable 首字段；"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件声明的 ABI 版本** 在 `PluginHandle::abi_version`，是 `plugin_init` 的返回值——\n静态检查看不到，**装载时才判定**；"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查导出符号","content":"**插件自己的 crate 版本** 在 `plugin_manifest` 的 `version` 字段里。"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"1733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"1734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"脚本插件走另一条路（目录形，装进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`），见脚本插件。"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 找产物的顺序是 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档专为 workspace\n成员准备：`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 并不存在，\n靠父链一样能找到——**没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数**，找不着就直接指着产物装。"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                   | 先看                                                              |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 导出表里没有 `plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的七个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                        |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅是不是没注册成功（`HostApi::on` 返回的句柄 `is_valid()` 为假），或事件名写成了别名 |","table":"table-2"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                        |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | 不在本板块——见脚本插件 › 排查（manifest 身份段、`run()`、`uv` / `bun`、原生桥库） |","table":"table-2"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"TDLib 的方法名与参数名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具（元数据 + 处理器）、call_tool / call_tool_result、六阶段洋葱管线"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"注册工具：元数据 + 处理器"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"调用工具：请求号或同步结果"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"ABI v4 的 `register_tool` 收三个东西：JSON 描述、可选的处理器、处理器要用的 `user_data`。\n处理器是 `C-unwind` 的 `fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，返回 JSON 字符串。"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"只登记元数据（不提供执行能力）用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor)`，等价于\n`register_tool(descriptor, None, null)`。`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒\n（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"两条入口，按需选："},"1768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                            | 返回          | 用途                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |\n| `call_tool(name, input_json)` | `RequestId` | 只需要“发出去”，或将来接异步工具 |","table":"table-1"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                                   | 返回          | 用途                              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `call_tool_result(name, input_json)` | 结果 JSON 字符串 | **同步**拿结果（失败是 `{\"error\": \"…\"}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool_result` 的顺序是："},"1771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"call_tool_result 的五步链路"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步调用工具时，宿主依次做：按名字查表、过权限门、校验入参 schema、跑处理器、校验出参 schema；任一步失败就返回 error 对象。"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步链路：任一步不过就到此为止"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"查表"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"名字 → 注册项"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"权限门"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"required_…"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"入参校验"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"input_schema"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"处理器"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"C-unwind 回调"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"出参校验"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":