ls#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"进入段"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之前的代码"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run(ctx)"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"交给下一层"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"退出段"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之后的代码"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"外层先进后出；回调返回非 0 就中断这一阶段；不调 next.run 就是不往下走"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-2"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-2"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-2"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-2"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-2"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-2"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"1808":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧 `MiddlewareHandle` 只是一个 `u64`，drop 不会摘除；注册后一直有效到插件卸载。"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/script","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/script-0","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"Python / JS / TS 写逻辑：由独立的 fuyubot.script 插件托管，不编译、装上就跑"},"1816":{"id":"/docs/script-1","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"它是怎么搭起来的"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/script-2","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"装宿主插件"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/script-3","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"前置条件"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/script-4","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"写第一个脚本"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/script-5","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"装进机器人"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/script-6","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/script-7","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"脚本目录在哪"},"1823":{"id":"/docs/script-8","page_id":"/docs/script","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"排查"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/script-9","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"**运行时不认识 Python，也不认识 JavaScript。** 脚本能力**完全由另一个插件提供**：\nFuyuBot-Script 打出的 `fuyubot.script`。\n它本身就是一个普通的 ABI 插件——装进 `plugins/` 之后，替宿主去扫 `plugins/scripts/`、\n给每个脚本起一个子进程、把事件和请求来回搬。"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/script-10","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"所以这一块和「插件开发」是两件事："},"1826":{"id":"/docs/script-11","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）               |\n| ----- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| 谁提供能力 | 运行时本体      | 独立的 `fuyubot.script` 插件 |","table":"table-0"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/script-12","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发）                     | 脚本插件（本板块）             |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 你写什么 | Rust / C / C++ / Go，编译成 cdylib | Python / JS / TS，一个目录 |","table":"table-0"},"1828":{"id":"/docs/script-13","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|      | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块） |\n| ---- | ---------- | --------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要          | 不要        |","table":"table-0"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/script-14","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|     | 原生插件（插件开发）   | 脚本插件（本板块）    |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"1830":{"id":"/docs/script-15","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script","content":"|       | 原生插件（插件开发） | 脚本插件（本板块）       |\n| ----- | ---------- | --------------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 可能拖垮宿主     | 只有那个子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/script-16","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"一个中间插件、两个语言运行时、N 个脚本进程："},"1832":{"id":"/docs/script-17","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**一个脚本一个进程**：脚本崩溃、死循环、内存涨爆，都只影响它自己。"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/script-18","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**stdio 协议**：脚本的 stdout / stdin 上跑「一行一个 JSON」。薄 SDK 把它包成函数调用，\n作者看不到任何 `op` / `tag` / `handle`。"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/script-19","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#它是怎么搭起来的","content":"**子作用域**：每个脚本的订阅、工具、中间件都落在自己的作用域里，停掉它只撤它自己的注册。"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/script-20","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"去 FuyuBot-Script Releases\n下载对应平台的 `fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`（例：`fuyubot-script-windows-x86_64.zip`）。"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/script-21","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"解压，把里面的 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` **整个目录**放进机器人的 `plugins/`。"},"1837":{"id":"/docs/script-22","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"重启 `fuyubot`。"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/script-23","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"`fuyubot plugin list` 的「原生插件包」那一段里能看到 `fuyubot.script`；\n「脚本插件」那一段列出 `plugins/scripts/` 里已经装好的脚本。"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/script-24","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装宿主插件","content":"运行时发行包里**不带**脚本能力：内置插件只有 `/start`、`/help`、`/plugins` 那几个。\n脚本插件单独发版、单独升级，装与不装都不影响运行时本体。"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/script-25","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言     | 要装  | 谁在用                                |\n| ------ | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Python | uv  | `uv sync` 装依赖，`uv run <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/script-26","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"| 语言      | 要装           | 谁在用                                 |\n| ------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | bun（≥ 1.3.1） | `bun install` 装依赖，`bun <entry>` 起脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/script-27","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#前置条件","content":"只缺其中一门，只会让那门语言的脚本起不来；机器人本体照常跑，日志里会有提示。"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/script-28","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"一个目录就是一个插件，身份写在 manifest 里。Python 用 `pyproject.toml`："},"1844":{"id":"/docs/script-29","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"JS / TS 用 `package.json`："},"1845":{"id":"/docs/script-30","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"入口文件只用薄 SDK，不需要任何构建步骤："},"1846":{"id":"/docs/script-31","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"按语言看完整方法表与示例："},"1847":{"id":"/docs/script-32","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/python/\" />"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/script-33","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#写第一个脚本","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/script/js-ts/\" />"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/script-34","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"整个目录被复制到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。目录名是装卸载的单位，\nmanifest 里的 `name` 是插件身份——两者不必相同（卸载时用目录名）。"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/script-35","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装进机器人","content":"要把它打成可分发的 zip（带 `plugin.json`、`kind` 写 `python` / `js`），见\n插件分发格式 v1。"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/script-36","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 整个目录拷进 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-2"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/script-37","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应                                               |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内发现 → `uv sync` / `bun install` → 起进程 → 等 `ready` |","table":"table-2"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/script-38","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 杀掉对应子进程并撤掉它的注册（跑着的实例上也安全） |","table":"table-2"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/script-39","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-2"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/script-40","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并停掉脚本 |","table":"table-2"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/script-41","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"两个数量级上的细节："},"1857":{"id":"/docs/script-42","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**启动有 10 秒预算**：`plugin_start` 最多等每个脚本 10 秒报 `ready`，超时算这个脚本失败。\n第一次 `uv sync` / `bun install` 可能更久——先手动装一遍依赖再启动会快很多。"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/script-43","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**只认目录增删，不做热更新**：watch 只比较「顶层有哪些脚本目录」，\n所以 `node_modules` / `.venv` 里的文件风暴不会触发任何动作，代价是改代码必须重启。"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/script-44","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#装好之后会发生什么","content":"脚本身份必须能被静态读到：Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]`、JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段。\n两样都没有的目录不是插件，`plugin list` 不会列它，`run` 也不会跑它。"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/script-45","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#脚本目录在哪","content":"固定是**插件目录下的 `scripts/`**（默认 `plugins/scripts/`），没有配置项可以改。\n想换地方就整体换插件目录（`fuyubot run --plugin-dir …` 或 `[plugins].dir`）。"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/script-46","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**`plugin list` 里没有某个脚本**：目录里没有身份段，或者入口文件不在，\n或者它在 `.disabled/` 里。"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/script-47","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**脚本起不来**：先看日志里那条 `ready` 超时/退出码；常见原因是 `uv` / `bun` 没装、\n依赖装不上、入口文件路径写错。"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/script-48","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：薄 SDK 要加载 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll。\n宿主起脚本时会自动设 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指过去，所以**别把 dll 挪出\n`plugins/fuyubot.script/`**；实在要挪就自己设这个变量。"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/script-49","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**改了代码没反应**：不热重载，重启机器人。"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/script-50","page_id":"/docs/script","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script#排查","content":"**想看得更细**：把 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`，脚本的 `log()` 会原样转发到宿主日志。"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","脚本插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"bun 上的薄 SDK：方法表、事件过滤、`_` 写 @type，以及异步写法"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"写 TDLib 参数：`_` 就是 `@type`"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"调 TDLib"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"异步：`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"日志、工具与中间件"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"现在还没有的能力"},"1876":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/script/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1877":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 脚本插件同样是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，`index.ts` 写逻辑，\n`fuyubot` 是从 npm 装的薄 SDK。宿主插件与安装流程见 脚本插件。"},"1878":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts","content":"要求 **bun ≥ 1.3.1**（SDK 用的是 `bun:ffi`，旧版本的 `cstring` 参数行为不一样）。\nTS 不需要额外配置，bun 直接跑 `.ts`。"},"1879":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | 订阅一条事件；返回回调对象，可交给 `off` |","table":"table-0"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法              | 干什么             |\n| --------------- | --------------- |\n| `off(callback)` | 退订 `on` 返回的那个对象 |","table":"table-0"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | 发一条 TDLib 请求；给了回调就按请求配对 |","table":"table-0"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 干什么                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `invoke` 的 Promise 版，只能在 `runAsync` 里用 |","table":"table-0"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter?, timeoutMs?)` | 等一条匹配的更新；超时/取消返回 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收得到） |","table":"table-0"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 干什么                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level?)` | 打日志；level：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace` |","table":"table-0"},"1886":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                               | 干什么                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `registerTool(name, description?, inputSchema?)` | 登记工具的**元数据**（没有执行回调） |","table":"table-0"},"1887":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 干什么                                           |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | 挂中间件，`handler(stage, payload)`，`stage` 是 0..5 |","table":"table-0"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                            |\n| ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `run()` | 发 `ready` 握手，然后阻塞收事件——**最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 干什么                                |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `runAsync(main?)` | Promise 版：原生桥在后台读 stdin，JS 事件循环继续跑 |","table":"table-0"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#方法一览","content":"和 Python 一样的两条：**不是装饰器**（`on` 是个普通函数）、**`run()` / `runAsync()`\n都阻塞到进程结束**，写在文件最后。"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"事件名就是 TDLib 更新的 `@type`，另外每条更新还会落到兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道。\n自己 `emit()` 的事件只送自己 + 全局订阅者。"},"1892":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#事件","content":"过滤器是「点分路径 = 期望值」，所有条件都相等才触发："},"1893":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"TDLib 的每个对象都要带判别字段 `@type`，写起来啰嗦。JS / TS 的 SDK 允许你写 `_`，\n发送前会**递归**换成 `@type`（`vector<T>` 里的对象也一样）；两个都写时以 `@type` 为准。"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#写-tdlib-参数_-就是-type","content":"这层规整只在 JS / TS 侧有，Python 侧要老老实实写 `\"@type\"`。"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#调-tdlib","content":"`invoke` 不阻塞、立刻返回；请求号由 SDK 配对。方法名与字段以 TDLib 为准（不是 Bot API），\n发送一律是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`。"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`runAsync` 在后台线程读 stdin，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 循环里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑，直到宿主关掉管道。"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`invokeAsync` 的 **TDLib 业务错误也会 resolve**（返回 `@type: \"error\"` 的对象），\n只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 是一次性订阅：命中或超时后自动退订；`timeoutMs=0` 表示一直等。"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#异步runasync--invokeasync--waitasync","content":"不用 `main` 也行：`await runAsync()` 只跑事件循环，`on` 回调里自己起异步任务。"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#日志工具与中间件","content":"中间件的六阶段与原生插件一致，见 工具与中间件。"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**回声机器人**："},"1902":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**："},"1903":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/js-ts#现在还没有的能力","content":"薄 SDK 只覆盖「收事件、发请求、打日志、登记工具、挂中间件」。下面这些宿主的 ABI\n有、但 JS / TS 侧**还没暴露**："},"1904":{"id":"/docs/script/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/script/js-ts",