able":"table-0"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/script/python-12","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法              | 干什么             |\n| --------------- | --------------- |\n| `off(callback)` | 退订 `on` 返回的那个对象 |","table":"table-0"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/script/python-13","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 干什么                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | 发一条 TDLib 请求；给了 `on_response` 就按请求配对回调 |","table":"table-0"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/script/python-14","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                  | 干什么                                          |\n| ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke_async(method, params=None)` | `invoke` 的 `await` 版，只能在 `run_async` 的事件循环里用 |","table":"table-0"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/script/python-15","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                      | 干什么                            |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `wait_async(filter=None, timeout_ms=0)` | `await` 一条匹配的更新；超时/取消返回 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/script/python-16","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 干什么                     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收得到） |","table":"table-0"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/script/python-17","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 干什么                                                       |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | 打日志；`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace` |","table":"table-0"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/script/python-18","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 干什么                  |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | 登记工具的**元数据**（没有执行回调） |","table":"table-0"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/script/python-19","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                                           |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | 挂中间件，`handler(stage, payload)`，`stage` 是 0..5 |","table":"table-0"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/script/python-20","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                              |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `run()` | 发 `ready` 握手，然后阻塞收事件——**永远最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/script/python-21","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 干什么                                                    |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `run_async(main=None)` | 同上，但跑 asyncio 事件循环；要 `invoke_async` / `wait_async` 就用它 |","table":"table-0"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/script/python-22","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"三个容易踩的："},"1936":{"id":"/docs/script/python-23","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**不是装饰器**。`@on(\"updateNewMessage\")` 会报错，老老实实写 `on(\"updateNewMessage\", handler)`。"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/script/python-24","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**回调只在 `run()` / `run_async()` 之后才有**。模块顶层可以注册订阅、挂中间件，\n但事件要等握手完成才会来。"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/script/python-25","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#方法一览","content":"**`run()` 和 `run_async()` 都阻塞到进程结束**，写在文件最后，后面不要有代码。"},"1939":{"id":"/docs/script/python-26","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"事件有两个来源："},"1940":{"id":"/docs/script/python-27","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**TDLib 更新**：事件名就是更新的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded`……）。\n每条更新同时发到两条通道：具体的 `@type`，和兜底的 `\"update\"`。"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/script/python-28","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**你自己 `emit()` 的事件**：只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**，不会广播给别的插件。"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/script/python-29","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"**过滤器**是「点分路径 = 期望值」，所有条件都相等才触发："},"1943":{"id":"/docs/script/python-30","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。订阅会一直有效到进程结束，\n需要提前退订就留住 `on` 的返回值、交给 `off`。"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/script/python-31","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"`method` 是 TDLib 的方法名（**不是** Bot API），`params` 是方法参数（不需要写 `@type`）。\n给了 `on_response` 时，响应回来会调它——请求号由 SDK 配对，你不用记。"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/script/python-32","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立刻返回。不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」；\n要等结果请用异步版，别在回调里轮询。"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/script/python-33","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#调-tdlib","content":"方法名和字段拿不准就查 TDLib 文档或 `td_api.tl`：发送一律是 `sendMessage` +\n`input_message_content`，`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` 这类 Bot API 名字在 TDLib 里不存在。"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/script/python-34","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"同步的 `run()` 没有事件循环，回调里不能 `await`。要 `await` 就把启动换成 `run_async`："},"1948":{"id":"/docs/script/python-35","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`run_async` 把读 stdin 的原生桥放到后台线程，主线程跑 asyncio 事件循环；\n`main` 在握手之后作为任务启动，函数返回后循环继续跑，直到宿主关掉管道。"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/script/python-36","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`invoke_async` 的 **TDLib 业务错误也会 resolve**（返回 `@type: \"error\"` 的对象），\n只有宿主拒绝请求时才抛异常——别指望 `try/except` 接住 TDLib 的报错。"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/script/python-37","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性**订阅：命中或超时后自动退订；`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/script/python-38","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#异步run_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"不想用 `main` 也行：`run_async()` 只跑事件循环，`on` 回调里自己\n`asyncio.create_task(...)`。"},"1952":{"id":"/docs/script/python-39","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#日志工具与中间件","content":"中间件的六阶段与原生插件一致，细节见 工具与中间件。"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/script/python-40","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"**回声机器人**——只复读别人发的文本："},"1954":{"id":"/docs/script/python-41","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的，靠过滤器分流："},"1955":{"id":"/docs/script/python-42","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"薄 SDK 只覆盖「收事件、发请求、打日志、登记工具、挂中间件」。下面这些宿主的 ABI\n有、但 Python 侧**还没暴露**，遇到需要它们的场景只能等 SDK 补："},"1956":{"id":"/docs/script/python-43","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"读写 `[plugin.<名字>]` 配置段"},"1957":{"id":"/docs/script/python-44","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"调用其它插件注册的工具 / 共享服务"},"1958":{"id":"/docs/script/python-45","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"`simplify` 操作表（发消息等结局、Markdown → entities 之类）"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/script/python-46","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#现在还没有的能力","content":"原生插件不受这个限制，见 插件 ABI。"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/script/python-47","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**`ModuleNotFoundError: fuyubot`**：依赖没装进脚本自己的 `.venv`。在脚本目录里\n`uv add fuyubot`，再重启机器人（或先手动 `uv sync`）。"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/script/python-48","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：SDK 靠 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 找 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll，\n宿主起脚本时会自动设好；把 dll 挪出 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 就会失效。\n排法见 脚本插件 › 排查。"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/script/python-49","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python -m fuyubot` 只验证 API 形状、不碰宿主，输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`；\n它仍要能加载原生桥，先把 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指到 `fuyubot_script` 那份 dll。"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/script/python-50","page_id":"/docs/script/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/script/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段先判空**：不同更新类型字段位置不同；`updateNewMessage` 的文本在\n`message.content.text.text`，而且 `message.content` 可能根本没有 `text`。"},"1964":{"id":"/docs/usage/build","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"page","content":"从源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build"},"1965":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"开发者路线：自己编 fuyubot"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"前置"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"构建"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"编出来的东西在哪"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"发布包是怎么出的"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"自检"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"普通用户请走 下载与安装——发布包里有可执行文件和 `tdjson`，不用编译。\n这一页是给要改代码、或者平台没有发布包（比如 Intel Mac）的人。"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| Rust | 1.99+（`edition 2024`） |","table":"table-0"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置      | 要求                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Windows | MSVC 工具链（Rust / C / C++ 插件都用它链接） |","table":"table-0"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                   |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 构建输入 | 一份 `td_api.tl`（下面说明） |","table":"table-0"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置  | 要求                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 运行期 | `tdjson` 动态库（构建期会被拷到可执行文件同级） |","table":"table-0"},"1976":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它——`TDLIB_TD_API_TL`（显式指定，优先级最高）→ **包内 `vendor/<tdlib-version>/td_api.tl`** → 缓存 → 从 GitHub Releases 下载，拿不到就让**构建失败**。包内那份随 crate 一起发布（1.8.69 已带），所以从 crates.io 装下来的下游与 docs.rs **不用联网**；升 `tdlib-version` 时要记得补 `vendor/<新版本>/`。缓存根顺序：`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` → `$CARGO_HOME/fuyubot-tdlib-vendored` → 项目本地 `<工作区>/.tdlib-cache`。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把最后一档指好，在仓库里敲命令不用先 export。"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"转换在**编译期**完成，构建日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于构建时用的那份文件（本机三千多条），**不是常量**，别当断言用。"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`tdjson` 是**运行时**动态加载的，编译期不依赖它存在——所以构建成功不代表运行找得到。构建期 `fuyubot-tdlib/build.rs` 会把它（连同那个目录里的兄弟 DLL）拷到可执行文件同级目录，`target/debug/fuyubot.exe` 拷走就能跑。唯一例外是 `cargo install` 装出来的二进制：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放。"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                           | 产物                         | 说明  |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| `cargo build -p fuyubot-cli` | `target\\debug\\fuyubot.exe` | 开发用 |","table":"table-1"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                           | 说明                  |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cargo package-bot` | `target\\release\\fuyubot.exe` | 本地打包（tdjson 已在同级目录） |","table":"table-1"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令          | 产物  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `cargo bot` | —   | 一键 `fuyubot run` 当前目录 |","table":"table-1"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"别名就这三个，都写在仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml`（只影响本仓）。"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"本文档其余页面里的 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot.exe` 指的就是这些产物；从发布包安装的用户手里就是解压出来的那个。"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"`.github/workflows/release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag 上按平台编 `fuyubot` 与三个内置插件，\n**分开**打两份中间包（本体 / 插件），`publish` 再把它们叠成各平台一个 zip：\n解压得到 `<资产名>/`，里面有可执行文件、该平台的 `tdjson`（从 `TDLib-v<版本>` 那个 Release 取）\n和 `plugins/`。\n名字与 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表同一套口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`），\n加平台时两边一起加。"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"真 TDLib 的端到端自检（要本机的 `tdjson`）："},"1986":{"id":"/docs/usage/config","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"page","content":"配置文件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"fuyubot.toml 的字段与默认值"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"字段"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件自己的配置段"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"三层：包默认 / 运行时落盘 / 你写的"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"读写"},"1992":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"几条约定"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改了配置怎么生效"},"1994":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"`fuyubot run` 读 `fuyubot.toml`，**所有键都有默认值**。缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份（等价于先跑一次 `fuyubot init`）——`--replay` 是例外，它不会为了回放在你的目录里留配置。"},"1995":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"> `run --tui` 的**配置页**可以直接改核心项：`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑，写回时保留注释与 CRLF。\n> 运行中改完需重启实例；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 / 密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。"},"1996":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"一个项目目录长这样："},"1997":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键            | 默认值       | 它决定什么                     |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `[bot].name` | `fuyubot` | 显示名（启动那行、`status` 里的「名字」） |","table":"table-0"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                             |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[bot].api_id` | `0` | **旧位置**；`[telegram].api_id` 优先。新配置写进 `[telegram]` |","table":"table-0"},"1999":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                         |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].account_type` | `bot` | 登录走哪条路：`bot` → Bot Token；`user` → 手机号 / 扫码。**写错报错**，不会静默当 bot |","table":"table-0"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                   | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].api_id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（到 my.telegram.org 申请）。不是秘密；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"2001":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `[telegram].data_dir` | `data` | TDLib 的数据目录：database 与 files **都**指它。相对项目根 |","table":"table-0"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键               | 默认值       | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].dir` | `plugins` | `run` 从这里加载插件（动态库 + `scripts/` 下的脚本插件）；`--plugin-dir` 覆盖它 |","table":"table-0"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                                                                                   |\n| --------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].log_level` | `info` | 插件日志的最低级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace。排查插件时调成 `\"debug\"`；**写错级别名会报错**。运行中也可以在 `run --tui` 的日志页按 `Tab` 聚焦工作区后按 `l` 临时调整（只对本次运行生效） |","table":"table-0"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                          |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `[tdlib].path` | 空   | 留空 = 按四级优先级自动找 tdjson；指定时给 tdjson 的**目录**或文件路径 |","table":"table-0"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[tdlib].log_verbosity` | `1` | TDLib 日志详细度。TDLib 自己的默认更啰嗦（每轮 `td_receive` 的超时都打到 stderr）；负数按 0 处理 |","table":"table-0"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值 | 它决定什么        |\n| ---------------- | --- | ------------ |\n| `[plugin.<插件名>]` | 无   | 插件自己的配置段（见下） |","table":"table-0"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"每个插件在 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下可以有自己的配置，键值任意、可嵌套。插件名是点分的\n（`define_plugin!` / 脚手架里登记的那个名字，如 `fuyubot.manage`），所以在 TOML 里自然写成\n嵌套表——`[plugin.fuyubot.manage]` 就代表插件 `fuyubot.manage` 那段："},"2008":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"插件读到的配置是三层叠出来的，**后面的只填前面的缺失键**："},"2009":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层   | 在哪                                                        | 谁写        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| 包默认 | 插件包里的 `config.default.toml`（`plugin.json` 的 `config` 指向它） | 插件作者，随包升级 |","table":"table-1"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层     | 在哪                               | 谁写              |\n| ----- | -------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| 运行时落盘 | `<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml` | 插件 `set_config` |","table":"table-1"},"2011":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"| 层    | 在哪                              | 谁写    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 用户配置 | `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]` | **你** |","table":"table-1"},"2012":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#三层包默认--运行时落盘--你写的","content":"也就是说：**你在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写了的键，优先级最高**，插件改不动它（`set_config`\n会直接返回错误，而不是「这次改成功、下次启动又被你盖回去」）。想让插件自己管某个键，\n就别在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写它。"},"2013":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"插件在**运行时**读它、写它，走的是 ABI 接口（不是 `plugin_start` 的那个 `config_json`）："},"2014":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**读**：`get_config(section, key)` —— 读任意段（自己的 + 别人的）。`section` 空串读顶层\n（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），`key` 空串读整段，`key` 是点路径（`nested.k`）。"},"2015":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**写**：`set_config(key, value_json)` —— **只能写自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。成功 = 写内存 + 落盘到 `plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`；宿主这次启动没有配置文件、或这个键被用户配置钉住时**直接报错**。"},"2016":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"`fuyubot.toml` **运行时永远不会被插件改写**：你手写的注释、顺序、`api_hash` 都不会被卷走。"},"2017":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"各语言的写法：Rust 插件、C / C++ 插件，\n函数签名在插件 ABI。**脚本插件的薄 SDK 目前还没有读写配置的接口**——\n脚本要参数只能写在脚本目录里（跟着目录一起装），配置段暂时读不到。"},"2018":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"`plugin-config/<插件名>.toml` 是**插件自己的记忆**：文件内容就是那一段配置本身（不带\n`[plugin.x]` 头），插件名里的特殊字符按 `%XX` 编码。删掉这个文件 = 让插件忘掉它自己存过的东西\n（包默认和 `fuyubot.toml` 不受影响）。写入是先写 `.toml.tmp` 再 `rename`，掉电不会留半截文件。"},"2019":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**从旧版本升级**：以前插件把状态直接写进 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<名>]`。升级后那些键算\n「用户配置」，优先级最高——插件再写它们会被拒绝。把想交还给插件管的键从 `fuyubot.toml`\n删掉即可（值会转到 `plugin-config/` 那一层继续用）。"},"2020":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"模板（`fuyubot init` 生成的就是它）："},"2021":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#读写","content":"**凭据的边界**：`api_id` 与 `api_hash` 是**例外**——它们**每次冷启动**都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发给 TDLib（session 还有效也一样），不记住就得每次手输，所以 `fuyubot run` 交互式问过之后会把它们**明文写回** `[telegram]` 段。这意味着这份文件从此带着你的应用密钥：**别提交进版本库、别整份发给别人**。不想落盘就设 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`（环境变量优先，且不会被写回）。Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码仍然**一律不落盘**，只认环境变量或交互输入（连日志也不许出现）。session 由 TDLib 自己落在 `data_dir`，配置里不记任何登录态。"},"2022":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-35","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**相对路径相对配置文件所在目录**（也就是项目根）：`plugins`、`data`、日志目录都按它解析。\n插件也吃这一条：`fuyubot run` 在加载插件之前会把**进程工作目录切到项目根**，所以插件配置里的相对路径（如 `cache` / `Cache`）和插件起的子进程，都落在 `fuyubot.toml` 旁边，而不是「你在哪个目录敲的命令」。"},"2023":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-36","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**自动 init 只认默认文件名**：缺 `fuyubot.toml` 时 `run` 会生成一份；但用 `--config 别的名字` 时不会凭空造，直接报错。"},"2024":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-37","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`status` / `stop` **不替你造配置**：找不到 `fuyubot.toml` 就报「先 `fuyubot init` 建一个」——面对的是已经存在的实例，凭空建一个只会更迷惑。"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-38","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`--plugin-dir` 覆盖 `[plugins].dir`，`--config` 换配置文件本身。"},"2026":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-39","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"想知道**某一行到底生效成了什么**（含默认值）：`fuyubot config` 直接打出来，见 `fuyubot` 命令参考。"},"2027":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-40","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"字段读出来后，运行参数（凭据来源、加载顺序）见 运行与实例管理；`account_type` 之外没有别的自定义登录入口。"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-41","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"配置在 `run` 启动时读一次。改完要重启实例："},"2029":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-42","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"`--replay` 不占单实例锁，所以它可以和跑着的实例并存、跑完就退，适合改插件期间反复试。"},"2030":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-43","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改完先别急着重启：`fuyubot config --config demo\\fuyubot.toml` 会打印生效值，`account_type` 之类写错时当场就能看出来（那一行是 `⚠️` 开头，而 `run` 要走到登录才报）。"},"2031":{"id":"/docs/usage/env","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"page","content":"环境变量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env"},"2032":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"每个变量的读取者与作用"},"2033":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"构建期 vs 运行期"},"2034":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"凭据"},"2035":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"只在自动 init 那一次生效"},"2036":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                | 谁读                                    | 作用                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs`（**构建期**） | 显式指定 `td_api.tl`，优先级最高（完全离线构建就这么干） |","table":"table-0"},"2037":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                             | 谁读                     | 作用                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` | 两个 `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 缓存根：`td_api.tl` 与 vendored 动态库都放这儿。**必须绝对路径**（build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根） |","table":"table-0"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                            | 谁读                  | 作用                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_RELEASES_REPO` | `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 覆盖 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] releases-repo`（默认 `CatMoeCircle/Fuyu-Bot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                  | 谁读           | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` | 加载器（**运行期**） | tdjson 的目录或文件，查找优先级 1；嫌四级排查麻烦就直接设它 |","table":"table-0"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量          | 谁读                      | 作用                                                             |\n| ----------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_ID` | `fuyubot run` / `login` | TDLib api_id（**不是**秘密）。参与凭据解析（`--api-id` 之后、配置之前），也顺手带进自动生成的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量            | 谁读                             | 作用                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_HASH` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | api_hash，**凭据**。它优先于配置里已保存的值，且不会被写回 |","table":"table-0"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                             | 作用                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_BOT_TOKEN` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | bot 账号的 token；有值就不问 Bot Token，后台运行也能登 |","table":"table-0"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                               | 作用                                  |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_NAME` | `fuyubot run` / `login` 的自动 init | 自动生成配置时的 `[bot].name`（默认 `fuyubot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                     | 谁读          | 作用                                            |\n| ---------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_REGISTRY_URL` | TUI 商店（运行期） | 临时覆盖 `[plugins].registry_url`（商店索引地址）；优先级高于配置 |","table":"table-0"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"**`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` 只在构建期读。** 运行期用的是构建时烤进二进制的路径（`cargo:rustc-env` 写进去的 `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_DIR`——那是构建产物，不是让你设的变量）。运行时动态库最终由加载器的四级优先级决定，**不读** `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE`。"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"缓存根是一串候选，顺序即优先级："},"2047":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"前两档写不进去时会退到项目本地那档；**全都写不进去**才退到 `$OUT_DIR`——那个目录每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空，于是下次构建会重新下载（构建脚本会明确警告）。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把项目本地那档指好了。"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"**Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码一律不落盘**：不得写进仓库任何文件、`fuyubot.toml`、测试夹具或日志，只允许**环境变量**与**交互式输入**两个来源。`api_id` / `api_hash` 是例外——它们每次冷启动都要发给 TDLib，`run` 问过之后会明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（见 配置文件），所以那份文件要当密钥看待。"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_id` **不是**凭据，写进配置没问题（`[telegram].api_id`）。"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_hash` 三个来源，按序：`TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的（`[telegram].api_hash`）→ 交互提问。问出来的会被写回配置，之后就不用再输。"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"后台运行没有 stdin：没有 session、也没 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败；首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了，先在前台 `run` 一次（或设好上表那两个环境变量）。"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`FUYUBOT_NAME` 只在 `run` / `login` **自动生成配置**时被读（缺 `fuyubot.toml`，或 `--config` 指向默认文件名而它不存在）。配置已存在就不参与——否则每次跑都会覆盖你手写的名字。"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`TG_API_ID` 不一样：它除了带进自动生成的配置，还是**每次** `run` / `login` 解析 `api_id` 的一档\n（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问）。它只覆盖 `api_id`，不会动 `[bot].name`。"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/usage","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/usage-0","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"下载对应平台的包，解压就能跑"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/usage-1","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"下载哪个包"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/usage-2","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"解压、验证"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/usage-3","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"起一个 bot 项目"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/usage-4","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"跑起来"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/usage-5","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"不接账号先验一遍"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/usage-6","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"目录布局"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/usage-7","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"下一步"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/usage-8","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"不用装 Rust、不用编译：到 Releases 下对应平台的 zip，\n解压后里面就是可执行文件，**TDLib 动态库已经和它放在同一个目录**（运行时按「可执行文件所在目录」\n自动找到，不用配环境变量、不用单独装 TDLib），内置插件在同级的 `plugins/`。"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/usage-9","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"资产名是 **`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**（例：`fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`）：\n`<版本>` 就是 Release 版本号，带在名字里方便一眼看出下的是哪个；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64（cargo 口径，和 TDLib 自己的资产同序）。"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/usage-10","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                 | 资产                                | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 10/11（x64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/usage-11","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                | 资产                                 | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 11（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/usage-12","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统            | 资产                              | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（x86_64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/usage-13","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统           | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/usage-14","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                   | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS（Apple Silicon） | `fuyubot-<版本>-macos-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.dylib` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/usage-15","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**解压出来就是本体**：zip 里没有额外的一层目录，建议先建一个空目录再往里解压。"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/usage-16","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"归档一律 `.zip`（Windows 资源管理器双击就能解，Linux / macOS 用 `unzip`）。"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/usage-17","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**上面没有的平台**（Intel Mac 等）暂时没有包，自己编：见 从源码构建。"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/usage-18","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"想让机器人支持 Python / JS / TS 脚本，再去下脚本插件\n的 `fuyubot-script-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，解压后把 `plugins/fuyubot.script/` 放进插件目录。"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/usage-19","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"先建一个空目录再解压（zip 里没有套层目录，直接解到当前目录会把文件摊开）："},"2075":{"id":"/docs/usage-20","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"Linux / macOS："},"2076":{"id":"/docs/usage-21","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"macOS 从网上下载的二进制会被 Gatekeeper 拦住，解一次隔离属性："},"2077":{"id":"/docs/usage-22","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"`--version` 能打印版本号，说明这个可执行文件本身没坏；真正加载 TDLib 是在 `run` 的时候\n（日志里会有一行 `TDLib 1.8.69 命中「可执行文件所在目录」`——版本号是构建时声明的那个）。加载失败按\n常见问题 排查。"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/usage-23","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"`api_id` 到 my.telegram.org 申请，**它不是秘密**，可以直接写进配置；`api_hash` 是凭据，\n但每次启动都要发给 TDLib，所以 `run` 首次问过之后会把明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（也可以事先设环境变量 `TG_API_HASH`\n让它一次都不问）——那份文件要当密钥看待，别提交进版本库（见 配置文件）。"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/usage-24","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"真账号的最后一环**没有端到端验过**：`run` 会问凭据、驱动授权状态机、`getMe` 打印账户，然后才开分发；\n真库上的登录与 session 复用是在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 `-- --ignored` 自检里验的，但「收真更新 → 插件回一条」\n还没有真账号证据。想先确认插件行为，用下面的 `--replay` 或 `--no-login`。"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/usage-25","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"**没有插件也能起**（「插件 0 个」），插件是后装的：拿到编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib` 之后"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/usage-26","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"插件怎么编见 插件总览。"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/usage-27","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"回放是**离线**的：把一批更新 JSON 灌进整条管线，请求只留档、不发到 Telegram。先写一条最小的回放文件："},"2083":{"id":"/docs/usage-28","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"退出码 0 表示回放成功。细节（`--replay-wait`、脚本插件要等静默窗口）见 离线回放。"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/usage-29","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"`fuyubot init` 建出来的项目："},"2085":{"id":"/docs/usage-30","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/usage/config/\" />"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/usage-31","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"运行与实例管理\" href=\"/docs/usage/run/\" />"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/usage-32","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/usage-33","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" />"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/usage-34","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/usage/troubleshooting/\" />"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/usage-35","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"从源码构建\" href=\"/docs/usage/build/\" />"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"page","content":"离线回放","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"不接账号验证插件"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"输出里看什么"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"慢插件与脚本插件：`--replay-wait`"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"插件目录别指 `target\\debug`"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"与实例的关系"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"`fuyubot run --replay` 把一批更新的 JSON 灌进整条管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，用来在任何机器上验插件。"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"**每条 update 打一行**，`listeners` 是收到它的订阅数。退出码 0 表示回放成功，非零表示插件加载或回放本身失败。"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落                                 | 含义                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `回放 <@type> → UpdateOutcome { … }` | 管线跑完一条更新的结果。`warnings` 非空说明有阶段或回调抱怨过 |","table":"table-0"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `插件打出来的日志：` | 插件 `log` 的原样回显（`Info mybot: init` / `start()` 是插件生命周期） |","table":"table-0"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `插件发出去的请求：` | 插件请求的**留档**。回放不连 Telegram，所以请求不会真的发出去 |","table":"table-0"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"回放是离线路径，所以插件发请求只留档、也不会等响应——要验「响应回到插件」用真 TDLib，并准备好账号。"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"回放完不是立刻退出，而是等一个**安静窗口**再看结果。窗口的默认值按插件形态自动选："},"2104":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                                                        | 默认窗口    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| 有脚本（`plugins/scripts/` 下有目录，或插件包里 `kind` 是 `python` / `js`） | 2000 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                     | 默认窗口   |\n| ------------------------ | ------ |\n| 纯原生（Rust / C / C++ / Go） | 150 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"脚本插件跑在子进程里：事件要经管道过去、反应再经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求，\n窗口太短会把它们的日志与请求整批漏掉。插件要发慢速网络请求就把它调大："},"2107":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"`--plugin-dir` 要指向「只放你要验的插件」的目录。指 `target\\debug` 会把整仓的示例产物一起加载，\n任何一个起不来都会让输出混进一堆「跳过 xxx」。"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"正确做法是先装到一个干净目录再回放："},"2109":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"`--replay` **不占单实例锁、不发布状态**：同一个目录可以一边跑着实例、一边回放。它也**不会自动 init**（回放不该因为你试了一次就在当前目录留下 `fuyubot.toml`），没有配置就按默认值跑，也不碰 `.fuyubot/` 里的实例状态。"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放**不接 TDLib**（无论有没有 `tdjson`）：这是硬约定，否则回放就要账号和网络。"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"要看运行中的实例、后台跑、优雅停止，见 运行与实例管理。"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放里插件加载失败，多半是 ABI 版本或路径的问题，见 常见问题。"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/usage/run","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"page","content":"运行与实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"前台/后台运行、status、stop 与单实例锁"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"一个目录一个实例"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"前台运行"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台运行"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"操作面板（`--tui`）"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"看状态"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"停掉"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"常见情形"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"实例状态与运行期控制放在 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/` 下，**每件事各占一个文件**："},"2123":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/lock` | **只用来独占**（`try_lock`，进程死即释放）。里面不存内容——Windows 的文件锁是强制的，别的进程读不到被锁的字节 |","table":"table-0"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                | 作用                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/status` | `key=value`：pid / started / version / log_level / plugins / name。**启动完成之后**才发布（拿上锁只说明进程活着） |","table":"table-0"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/stop` | 停止请求，内容是 PID。`fuyubot stop` 先写它，让实例自己收摊 |","table":"table-0"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                   | 作用                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/log-level` | **可选的运行期控制**：面板在日志页按 `l` 写它，实例每 500ms 读一次并切换插件日志级别；新实例拿锁时清掉，不会带到下一轮 |","table":"table-0"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"第二次 `run`（前台后台都算）会被拒，报错里带上在跑的那个 PID。"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"陈旧的 `lock` **不用手工清理**：拿锁时会顺手删掉上一个实例的 `status` / `stop` / `log-level`。"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"`--replay` **不占锁、不发布状态**：离线开发路径不该和跑着的实例互斥。"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"顺序是固定的：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** → 发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 最后才开分发。插件先于登录加载，是为了不漏掉登录窗口里的更新。"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                     |\n| --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--config <路径>` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                  | 作用         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的插件目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 覆盖配置里的 `api_id`（**不是**秘密）。优先级：`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问；`api_hash` 没有对应参数 |","table":"table-1"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 只起框架、不走登录流程（CI / 容器；已有 session 仍会被 TDLib 打开） |","table":"table-1"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数             | 作用    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| `--background` | 放到后台跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数               | 作用                                             |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `--tui`（短写 `-t`） | 打开终端操作面板（见下节）；与 `--background` / `--replay` 互斥 |","table":"table-1"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                                       | 作用     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `--replay <JSON>` / `--replay-wait <MS>` | 见 离线回放 |","table":"table-1"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"凭据来源（按序）：`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的 `[telegram].api_id` / `.api_hash` → 交互式提问。**交互问出来的会被写回配置文件**，下次冷启动不用再输（这两个值每次都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发出去，session 有效也一样）。Bot Token 仍只认 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 或交互输入、不落盘，详见 环境变量。"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"它派生一个没有终端的自己，stdout/stderr 写进 `<目录>logs\\fuyubot.log`（每次新启动先清空旧日志）；父进程等子进程**真起来**（`.fuyubot/status` 发布）才返回。"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台跑**没有 stdin**。要交互式登录的场合（还没有 session、也没给 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`）会直接失败，并把日志尾巴打出来指路——先用前台 `run` 或 `fuyubot login` 登一次，session 会落在 `data/`。首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了：先在前台跑一次让它写回配置，或设好 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`。"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"想单独把登录走完而不起框架，用 `fuyubot login`；要退出登录（清掉本地会话）用 `fuyubot logout`。"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"打开的是**操作面板**，不是前台 bot：顶部版本栏（`[fuyubot - v…]`；实例运行中才显示状态，\n没跑时只显示刷新时间）、左侧导航、中央工作区、底部两行（当前可用操作 / 资源占用）。\n顶部和底部不铺背景色，当前焦点靠窗口边框高亮 + 底栏的 `[导航]` / `[工作区]` 标记。"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"底部资源行：`CPU · 内存 · 运行时长 · 插件数 · 日志级别 · PID`，采的是**运行中实例的 PID**\n（`sysinfo`）。实例没跑时 CPU / 内存 / 运行 / PID 显示 `—`、插件数为 0，日志级别显示\n面板下次启动会用哪一档；第一个采样点的 CPU 是 `0.0%`，下一秒才有真实值。"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                  |\n| ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift+Tab` | 切换焦点：导航 ↔ 工作区（边框高亮） |","table":"table-2"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Enter` / `Esc` | 导航 → 工作区 / 工作区 → 导航（在导航上按 `Esc` 才退出） |","table":"table-2"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `↑` / `↓`、`j` / `k` | 导航焦点：切页；工作区焦点：滚动日志 / 选择配置项 / 移动日志选择 |","table":"table-2"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                       |\n| --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `←` / `→` | 切换顶部标签页（窄屏横向导航；工作区焦点也生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-35","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用             |\n| --------- | -------------- |\n| `h` / `l` | 导航焦点：上一页 / 下一页 |","table":"table-2"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-36","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                         |\n| ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `1`–`5` | 直接跳到概览 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 / 帮助 |","table":"table-2"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-37","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                                         |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `Enter` | 日志页：进入日志选择模式；配置页：编辑选中的配置项（`e` 同）；插件页：开关选中项 |","table":"table-2"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-38","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                                                                        |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Space` | 插件页 + 工作区焦点：启用 / 禁用选中项（目录挪进 `plugins/.disabled/`，旧形态 dll 加 `.disable` 后缀） |","table":"table-2"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-39","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `y` | 日志选择模式：复制选中行（TDLib Update 复制完整 JSON） |","table":"table-2"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-40","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `s` | 启动 bot（派生 `run --background`，带上面板拿到的 `--api-id` / `--log-level` 等参数） |","table":"table-2"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-41","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                                                 |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `x` → `y` | 停止 bot（`y` 是确认；`.fuyubot/stop` 走插件的 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-2"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-42","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                    |\n| --- | --------------------- |\n| `r` | 立刻刷新状态 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 |","table":"table-2"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-43","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `l` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：调整运行中实例的日志级别（下一圈生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-44","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ |\n| `F` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：按级别 / 来源过滤日志 |","table":"table-2"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-45","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                        |\n| --- | ------------------------- |\n| `c` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：清空当前日志文件（要确认） |","table":"table-2"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-46","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| `f` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：跟随末尾开关 |","table":"table-2"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-47","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                             | 作用                                |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `PgUp` / `PgDn`、`Home` / `End` | 工作区焦点：日志 / 帮助翻页、首尾；配置页、插件页选择翻页、首尾 |","table":"table-2"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-48","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键           | 作用               |\n| ------------ | ---------------- |\n| `q`、`Ctrl+C` | 退出面板（不会停掉已启动的实例） |","table":"table-2"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-49","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"插件页的开关分两种形态："},"2164":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-50","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"**目录**（原生插件包、`plugins/scripts/<名字>/` 下的脚本目录）：整个挪进 `plugins/.disabled/`，\n再按一次挪回原来的位置；"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-51","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"**旧形态平铺 dll**：改名 `foo.dll` ↔ `foo.dll.disable`。"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-52","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"改完**重启实例**才生效：运行中的实例已经把插件映射进进程了，改名 / 挪目录不会让它当场卸载\n（Windows 上库被占用时改名还会直接失败，面板会报错；先 `x` 停止再按 `Space`）。\n加载器只扫启用态的路径，所以没有第二份「禁用清单」要跟插件目录同步。"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-53","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"面板**不占实例锁、不加载插件、不接 TDLib**——TDLib 的数据库同一时刻只能一个进程打开。\n它读 `.fuyubot/status`、配置、插件目录与 `logs/fuyubot.log`；启停都派生子进程，\n和手敲命令走同一条路，所以看到的就是真正在跑的那个实例。"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-54","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志级别是**运行期**的：配置里的 `[plugins].log_level` 决定启动值，日志页按 `l` 选的值只对\n**本次运行**生效（写 `.fuyubot/log-level`，实例下一圈读并切换），重启后回到配置值。\n`fuyubot status`、面板的日志页与概览都会显示当前生效的级别。"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-55","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志过滤（`F`）：级别是下限（`info+` = error / warn / info，排除 debug / trace），来源分\n**插件 / 宿主 / 管道 / 更新 / TDLib / 其他**。新日志格式按「插件行 / source 词」归类（旧四列\n也兼容）：`TDLib Update` 追踪归**更新**（级别 trace），TDLib C 库的 `[ N][t …]` 原样行归\n**TDLib**；认不出级别的启动提示按 info 对待。应用后底栏显示 `过滤 info+ · 全部` 与\n`x/y 行`，`c` 在弹框里一键重置。日志字段不按固定列补空格，长行按显示宽度折行\n（续行缩进两格）。"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-56","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"TDLib Update 行只显示 `@type`（如 `updateNewMessage`），不铺整段 JSON。日志页按 `Enter`\n进入选择模式，`↑↓` 选行，`y` / `Enter` 复制：TDLib Update 复制**完整 JSON**，其它行复制整行；\n`Esc` 退出选择。"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-57","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"后台实例每次新启动都会先清空 `logs/fuyubot.log`；日志页按 `c` 可手动清空当前日志\n（确认后清空并回到跟随末尾，运行中的实例继续写新行）。"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-58","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"窄终端（手机 / Termux）会自动收缩：宽度 < 60 列时导航移到工作区上方，变成一行\n横向标签，用 `←` / `→`（工作区焦点也生效）或 `h` / `l`（导航焦点）切换；更窄时标签\n退化成单字。底栏窄屏只留 `CPU / 内存 / 级别`，不显示运行时长、插件数量和 PID；\n配置项窄屏改成「完整键 + 值」两行，帮助页可 `↑↓` / `PgUp` / `PgDn` 滚动；日志窄屏只留\n`HH:MM:SS`、插件名最后一段和级别。复制优先 `termux-clipboard-set`（`termux-api`），\n否则 OSC 52。"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-59","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"配置页是**可编辑表格**：段 / 键 / 生效值 / 来源，`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑。\n文本、整数和枚举（`account_type` / `log_level`）先校验再写回；写回只替换那一行，\n保留注释、顺序和 CRLF。运行中保存的配置**重启后生效**；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 /\n密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。配置读不出来时页面显示错误原文，改好按 `r` 重读。"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-60","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"`status` 只读 `.fuyubot/`，**不加载插件、不接 TDLib**。三种结果：运行中 / 陈旧（没人在跑，附上次的 pid 与启动时间）/ 没有运行中的实例。还有一种是「有实例在跑、但状态还没发布」，也就是卡在启动里。"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-61","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"登录成功之后还会多一行「账户」（`名字 @用户名（id=…） [bot]`）：`getMe` 拿到就写进 status，\n之后 TDLib 用 `updateUser` 改名字 / 用户名时实例跟着刷新并重发——面板的概览页读的是同一份。"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-62","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"`stop` 的机制：写 `.fuyubot/stop` → 实例每 500 ms 看一次 → 停接收循环 → 卸载插件（跑 `plugin_stop`）→ 停内核 → 放锁；**8 秒不理会才硬杀兜底**。硬杀跑不到插件的 `plugin_stop`，所以别一上来就 `taskkill`。"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-63","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"**Ctrl-C 仍是硬杀**：捕获它要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature（会带进 `mio` + `signal-hook-registry` + `errno`，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅退出就用 `fuyubot stop`，别按 Ctrl-C。"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-64","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                        | 处理                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 重复 `run` 报「已经有实例在跑」，带 PID | 先 `status`，再 `stop`；不要手工删 `lock` |","table":"table-3"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-65","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象           | 处理                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `status` 说陈旧 | 正常，陈旧状态不用清理，下次 `run` 自己接管 |","table":"table-3"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-66","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                      | 处理                         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 后台启动后立刻 `status` 报「启动中」 | 状态是在插件加载 + 登录之后才发布的，等一会儿再看 |","table":"table-3"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-67","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象       | 处理                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 进程活着但没更新 | 没登录就收不到任何更新；先用 `--replay` 验插件 |","table":"table-3"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","content":"tdjson 找不到、%TEMP%、乱码、插件加载失败"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"找不到 tdjson"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"`LNK1104: cannot open file '...\\Temp\\lnk{GUID}.tmp'`"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"中文乱码 / 行号错位"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"插件加载失败"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"回放以非零码中止"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"收不到更新 / 进程停不下来"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"**构建成功不代表运行找得到**：`fuyubot-tdlib` 在编译期不依赖 tdjson 存在。缺库时 `run` 不会崩，而是打一行然后继续跑（插件照样加载，只是收不到更新）："},"2191":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"四级查找顺序（不要重排）："},"2192":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 指向的**文件**或**目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | vendored（构建期烤进去的目录）→ **可执行文件所在目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | Linux 带版本号的系统库（`libtdjson.so.1.8.69` …） |","table":"table-0"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | 裸库名（`tdjson.dll` / `libtdjson.so`，走 `PATH`） |","table":"table-0"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"报错里的 `[1]` … `[4]` 就是这四档的逐条结果，按顺序看就知道断在哪。嫌排查麻烦就直接指定："},"2197":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"加载动态库时会**先查库自己所在的目录**（Windows 上是 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`）。否则 tdjson 的兄弟依赖（libssl / zlib 之类）找不到，报的却是 `ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND`（126）——错误信息说「库不在」，实际缺的是它的依赖。所以 tdjson 和它的兄弟 DLL 要放在一起。"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"`cargo install` 装出来的二进制是唯一例外：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放到它旁边或设 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`。"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"这是 **MSVC 链接器写不了 `%TEMP%`**（受限环境 / 沙箱里常见），跟你的代码无关。把临时目录指到可写的位置："},"2200":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"同一坑的另一面：**测试不许依赖 `%TEMP%`**。仓库约定临时目录一律放 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`——MSYS（git bash）会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`（在 Windows 上解析成当前盘根），受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了。换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"本机 PowerShell 的默认代码页是 cp936：`Get-Content` 会把 UTF-8 当 **GBK** 解码，中文注释直接毁掉，还会**吞换行**导致行号错位（按行号删代码会删错）。看文件内容用编辑器或 `read` 工具，别用 shell 的文本通道读写源码。"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"脚本插件那条链路的 stdio 两侧已经钉成 UTF-8——Windows 上 Python 默认按系统代码页读管道，不钉就会把中文变乱码。这是 SDK 的职责，插件作者不用管。"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`run` 遇到加载不了的插件会打一行然后**继续**："},"2204":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`--plugin-dir` 下的东西会被逐个尝试，所以「少加载了一个」不会让整个进程失败——去看这行。"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 怎么查                                           |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ABI 版本是 N，宿主是 M` | 插件与宿主的 ABI 不匹配：用与宿主同版本的 `fuyubot-abi` 重新编译，别拿旧产物硬跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                        | 原因 / 怎么查                                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 缺 `plugin_init` / 根本不是动态库 | `dumpbin /exports`（Windows）或 `nm -D`（Linux/macOS）**静态**看导出符号 |","table":"table-1"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象       | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                   |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件没被加载 | 目录不在 `plugins/scripts/` 下，或缺 `[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"` 身份段；见脚本插件 › 排查 |","table":"table-1"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象              | 原因 / 怎么查                                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `.dll` 加载报找不到依赖 | 插件把兄弟 DLL 放自己旁边是支持的（加载器先查库所在目录），别把它挪走，也别只拷主 dll |","table":"table-1"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"脚本插件不和 dll 同目录：它住在 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，由 `fuyubot.script` 插件托管。\n上面那条「文件加载失败」只适用于原生插件。"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"多半是插件目录里有你不想要的东西：`--plugin-dir` 指向 `target/debug` 会把整仓示例产物一起加载，任何一个起不来都会让回放中止或输出混进「跳过 xxx」。把要验的插件装进一个干净目录即可。见 离线回放。"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象         | 处理                             |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 进程跑着但插件没反应 | 没登录就收不到任何更新。要立刻验插件用 `--replay` |","table":"table-2"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象            | 处理                                                         |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `stop` 之后进程还在 | `stop` 是写停止请求，实例每 500 ms 看一次；8 秒不理会才硬杀。硬杀跑不到 `plugin_stop` |","table":"table-2"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象           | 处理                                                                         |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------